{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"public static void main","summary":"Java プログラムの開始地点となるメソッドです。","examples":[{"code":"public class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    System.out.println(\"Hello\");\n  }\n}","note":"ファイル名は public クラス名（Main.java）と同じにします。"}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0001"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"System.out.println","summary":"標準出力へ1行表示します。print は改行なし、printf は書式付き。","examples":[{"code":"System.out.println(\"こんにちは\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0002"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"コメント","summary":"// は1行、/* */ は複数行、/** */ は Javadoc（説明書き）です。","examples":[{"code":"// メモ","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0003"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"パッケージ","summary":"クラスを整理するための名前空間です。ファイルの先頭に書きます。","examples":[{"code":"package com.example.app;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0004"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"import","summary":"別のパッケージのクラスを使えるようにします。","examples":[{"code":"import java.util.List;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0005"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"var","summary":"右辺から型を推測させるローカル変数宣言です（Java 10以降）。","examples":[{"code":"var list = new ArrayList<String>();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0006"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"final","summary":"変数なら再代入禁止、メソッドなら上書き禁止、クラスなら継承禁止にします。","examples":[{"code":"final int MAX = 10;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0007"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"static","summary":"インスタンスではなくクラスに属することを表します。","examples":[{"code":"static int count = 0;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0008"},{"lang":"java","category":"基本","term":"Scanner","summary":"キーボードやファイルから入力を読む標準クラスです。","examples":[{"code":"Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\nint n = sc.nextInt();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0009"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"int / long","summary":"整数型。int は約±21億、long はそれより大きな値も扱えます（数値の末尾に L）。","examples":[{"code":"long big = 3000000000L;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0010"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"double / float","summary":"小数型。double が標準で、float は数値の末尾に f を付けます。","examples":[{"code":"double d = 3.14;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0011"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"boolean","summary":"true か false を持つ型です。","examples":[{"code":"boolean ok = true;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0012"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"char","summary":"文字1つを表す型。シングルクォートで囲みます。","examples":[{"code":"char c = 'A';","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0013"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"String","summary":"文字列を表すクラス。一度作ると中身は変えられません。","examples":[{"code":"String s = \"abc\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0014"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"byte / short","summary":"小さな整数型（8ビット／16ビット）。","examples":[{"code":"byte b = 127;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0015"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"ラッパークラス","summary":"基本型を包んだクラス（Integer, Double など）。コレクションには基本型を直接入れられません。","examples":[{"code":"Integer n = 5;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0016"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"オートボクシング","summary":"基本型とラッパークラスを自動で変換する仕組みです。","examples":[{"code":"Integer n = 5;\nint m = n;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0017"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"キャスト","summary":"型を明示的に変換します。小数→整数では小数部が切り捨てられます。","examples":[{"code":"int i = (int) 3.9; // 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0018"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"BigDecimal","summary":"誤差が出ない小数計算（お金など）に使うクラスです。","examples":[{"code":"new BigDecimal(\"0.1\").add(new BigDecimal(\"0.2\"));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0019"},{"lang":"java","category":"データ型","term":"配列","summary":"同じ型の値を並べたもの。長さは作ったあと変えられません。","examples":[{"code":"int[] a = {1, 2, 3};\nSystem.out.println(a.length);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0020"},{"lang":"java","category":"演算子","term":"==  と equals","summary":"== は参照が同じか、equals は中身が同じかを調べます。文字列の比較は equals を使います。","examples":[{"code":"\"a\".equals(s)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0021"},{"lang":"java","category":"演算子","term":"三項演算子","summary":"条件 ? 値1 : 値2 の形で分岐します。","examples":[{"code":"String r = x > 0 ? \"正\" : \"負\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0022"},{"lang":"java","category":"演算子","term":"instanceof","summary":"オブジェクトがそのクラス（型）かを調べます。","examples":[{"code":"if (o instanceof String s) { ... }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0023"},{"lang":"java","category":"演算子","term":"%（剰余）","summary":"割り算のあまりを求めます。","examples":[{"code":"7 % 3; // 1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0024"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"if / else","summary":"条件で処理を分けます。","examples":[{"code":"if (n > 0) { ... } else { ... }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0025"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"switch 式","summary":"値に応じて結果を返せる新しい switch。-> を使い、break が不要です。","examples":[{"code":"String s = switch (d) {\n  case 1 -> \"月\";\n  default -> \"他\";\n};","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0026"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"for","summary":"回数を決めた繰り返し。","examples":[{"code":"for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0027"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"拡張for文","summary":"配列やコレクションの要素を順に取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"for (String s : list) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0028"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"while / do-while","summary":"条件が真の間、繰り返します。do-while は先に1回実行します。","examples":[{"code":"while (n > 0) { n--; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0029"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"break / continue","summary":"ループを抜ける／次の周回へ進みます。","examples":[{"code":"if (x == 0) continue;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0030"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"例外処理 try-catch-finally","summary":"エラーを捕まえて処理を続けます。finally は必ず実行されます。","examples":[{"code":"try {\n  Integer.parseInt(\"abc\");\n} catch (NumberFormatException e) {\n  System.out.println(\"数字ではありません\");\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0031"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"try-with-resources","summary":"使い終わったファイルなどを自動で閉じる構文です。","examples":[{"code":"try (var r = new BufferedReader(new FileReader(\"a.txt\"))) {\n  r.readLine();\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0032"},{"lang":"java","category":"制御構文","term":"throw / throws","summary":"throw は例外を投げ、throws はメソッドが投げうる例外を宣言します。","examples":[{"code":"void f() throws IOException { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0033"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"クラス","summary":"データ（フィールド）と処理（メソッド）をまとめた設計図です。","examples":[{"code":"class Dog { String name; void bark() { } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0034"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"コンストラクタ","summary":"インスタンスを作るときに実行される初期化処理。クラス名と同じ名前です。","examples":[{"code":"Dog(String name) { this.name = name; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0035"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"this","summary":"自分自身のインスタンスを指します。","examples":[{"code":"this.name = name;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0036"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"継承 extends","summary":"既存のクラスを引き継いで新しいクラスを作ります。","examples":[{"code":"class Puppy extends Dog { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0037"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"super","summary":"親クラスのコンストラクタやメソッドを呼びます。","examples":[{"code":"super(name);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0038"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"オーバーライド","summary":"親のメソッドを子で書き換えます。@Override を付けると間違いに気づけます。","examples":[{"code":"@Override\npublic String toString() { return name; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0039"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"オーバーロード","summary":"同じ名前で引数の違うメソッドを複数定義します。","examples":[{"code":"int add(int a, int b)\ndouble add(double a, double b)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0040"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"abstract","summary":"未完成の部分を持つクラスやメソッド。単独ではインスタンス化できません。","examples":[{"code":"abstract class Shape { abstract double area(); }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0041"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"interface","summary":"「できること」だけを約束する仕組み。クラスは複数実装できます。","examples":[{"code":"interface Flyable { void fly(); }\nclass Bird implements Flyable { public void fly() { } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0042"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"default メソッド","summary":"interface の中で、実装をもつメソッドです。","examples":[{"code":"interface A { default void hi() { } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0043"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"ポリモーフィズム","summary":"同じ呼び出しでも、実際のクラスによって動作が変わる性質です。","examples":[{"code":"Animal a = new Dog();\na.cry();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0044"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"アクセス修飾子","summary":"public（どこからでも）、protected（同パッケージ＋子）、無印（同パッケージ）、private（同クラスのみ）。","examples":[{"code":"private int age;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0045"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"getter / setter","summary":"private なフィールドを読み書きするメソッド。","examples":[{"code":"public int getAge() { return age; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0046"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"内部クラス","summary":"クラスの中に定義するクラス。","examples":[{"code":"class Outer { class Inner { } }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0047"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"匿名クラス","summary":"名前を付けずにその場で作るクラスです。","examples":[{"code":"new Runnable() { public void run() { } };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0048"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"enum","summary":"決まった値だけを持つ列挙型です。","examples":[{"code":"enum Color { RED, BLUE }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0049"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"record","summary":"データを持つだけのクラスを短く書ける型（Java 16以降）。getter や equals が自動で作られます。","examples":[{"code":"record Point(int x, int y) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0050"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"sealed","summary":"継承できるクラスを限定します。","examples":[{"code":"sealed interface S permits A, B { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0051"},{"lang":"java","category":"クラスと継承","term":"Object","summary":"すべてのクラスの親。toString, equals, hashCode を持ちます。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"java-0052"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"length / charAt","summary":"文字数／指定位置の文字を返します。","examples":[{"code":"\"abc\".charAt(1); // 'b'","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0053"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"substring","summary":"指定範囲の文字列を切り出します。","examples":[{"code":"\"abcdef\".substring(1, 3); // \"bc\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0054"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"indexOf","summary":"文字列が最初に見つかる位置を返します。なければ -1。","examples":[{"code":"\"hello\".indexOf(\"l\"); // 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0055"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"split","summary":"区切りで分割して配列にします。","examples":[{"code":"\"a,b\".split(\",\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0056"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"replace","summary":"文字列を置き換えます。","examples":[{"code":"\"a-b\".replace(\"-\", \"+\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0057"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"trim / strip","summary":"前後の空白を取り除きます。strip は全角空白にも対応します。","examples":[{"code":"\" a \".strip();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0058"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"String.format","summary":"書式を指定して文字列を作ります。","examples":[{"code":"String.format(\"%05d\", 42); // \"00042\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0059"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"String.join","summary":"要素を区切り文字でつなぎます。","examples":[{"code":"String.join(\",\", list);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0060"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"StringBuilder","summary":"文字列を効率よく連結するクラスです。繰り返しの連結に使います。","examples":[{"code":"var sb = new StringBuilder();\nsb.append(\"a\").append(\"b\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0061"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"テキストブロック","summary":"\"\"\" で囲んだ複数行の文字列（Java 15以降）。","examples":[{"code":"String s = \"\"\"\n  行1\n  行2\n  \"\"\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0062"},{"lang":"java","category":"String","term":"isEmpty / isBlank","summary":"空か／空白だけか、を調べます。","examples":[{"code":"\" \".isBlank(); // true","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0063"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"ArrayList","summary":"大きさを変えられる配列のようなリスト。","examples":[{"code":"List<String> l = new ArrayList<>();\nl.add(\"a\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0064"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"List.of","summary":"変更できないリストを手早く作ります。","examples":[{"code":"List<Integer> l = List.of(1, 2, 3);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0065"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"HashMap","summary":"キーと値の組を保持します。順序は保証されません。","examples":[{"code":"Map<String,Integer> m = new HashMap<>();\nm.put(\"a\", 1);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0066"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"TreeMap","summary":"キーの順に並んで保持されるマップです。","examples":[{"code":"new TreeMap<String,Integer>();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0067"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"LinkedHashMap","summary":"入れた順序を保つマップです。","examples":[{"code":"new LinkedHashMap<>();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0068"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"HashSet","summary":"重複を許さない集合です。","examples":[{"code":"Set<String> s = new HashSet<>();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0069"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"Deque / ArrayDeque","summary":"両端から出し入れできる。スタックやキューとして使います。","examples":[{"code":"Deque<Integer> d = new ArrayDeque<>();\nd.push(1);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0070"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"Iterator","summary":"要素を1つずつたどる仕組みです。ループ中に安全に削除できます。","examples":[{"code":"Iterator<String> it = l.iterator();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0071"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"Collections.sort","summary":"リストを並べ替えます。","examples":[{"code":"Collections.sort(list);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0072"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"Comparator","summary":"並べ替えの基準を表します。","examples":[{"code":"list.sort(Comparator.comparing(User::getAge));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0073"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"getOrDefault","summary":"キーがなければ既定値を返します。","examples":[{"code":"m.getOrDefault(\"x\", 0);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0074"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"computeIfAbsent","summary":"キーがなければ値を作って入れます。","examples":[{"code":"m.computeIfAbsent(\"k\", k -> new ArrayList<>());","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0075"},{"lang":"java","category":"コレクション","term":"ジェネリクス","summary":"<T> で型を引数のように扱い、型の安全性を高めます。","examples":[{"code":"List<String> l;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0076"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"ラムダ式","summary":"(引数) -> 処理 の形で書く、短い関数です。","examples":[{"code":"Runnable r = () -> System.out.println(\"hi\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0077"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"関数型インターフェース","summary":"抽象メソッドを1つだけ持つインターフェース。ラムダの型になります。","examples":[{"code":"@FunctionalInterface interface F { int f(int x); }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0078"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"メソッド参照","summary":"既存のメソッドを :: で渡す書き方です。","examples":[{"code":"list.forEach(System.out::println);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0079"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"Stream","summary":"コレクションの要素に対する処理を連ねて書くAPIです。","examples":[{"code":"list.stream().filter(n -> n > 1).map(n -> n * 2).toList();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0080"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"collect","summary":"Stream の結果をリストやマップなどにまとめます。","examples":[{"code":".collect(Collectors.groupingBy(String::length))","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0081"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"Optional","summary":"値があるかないかを安全に表す入れ物です。null の代わりに使います。","examples":[{"code":"Optional.ofNullable(s).orElse(\"既定\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0082"},{"lang":"java","category":"ラムダとStream","term":"reduce","summary":"要素を1つの値にまとめます。","examples":[{"code":"IntStream.rangeClosed(1, 4).sum();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0083"},{"lang":"java","category":"入出力","term":"Files.readAllLines","summary":"ファイルを行のリストとして読みます。","examples":[{"code":"List<String> l = Files.readAllLines(Path.of(\"a.txt\"));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0084"},{"lang":"java","category":"入出力","term":"Files.writeString","summary":"文字列をファイルへ書き込みます。","examples":[{"code":"Files.writeString(Path.of(\"a.txt\"), \"内容\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0085"},{"lang":"java","category":"入出力","term":"BufferedReader","summary":"文字を効率よく1行ずつ読みます。","examples":[{"code":"br.readLine();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0086"},{"lang":"java","category":"入出力","term":"Path / Paths","summary":"ファイルの場所を表します。","examples":[{"code":"Path p = Path.of(\"dir\", \"a.txt\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0087"},{"lang":"java","category":"入出力","term":"文字コード UTF-8","summary":"入出力では文字コードを明示すると文字化けを防げます。","examples":[{"code":"StandardCharsets.UTF_8","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0088"},{"lang":"java","category":"並行処理","term":"Thread","summary":"処理を並行に実行する単位です。","examples":[{"code":"new Thread(() -> work()).start();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0089"},{"lang":"java","category":"並行処理","term":"ExecutorService","summary":"スレッドプールを使って、処理をまとめて管理します。","examples":[{"code":"var ex = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(4);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0090"},{"lang":"java","category":"並行処理","term":"synchronized","summary":"同時に1つのスレッドしか入れない排他制御です。","examples":[{"code":"synchronized void inc() { count++; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0091"},{"lang":"java","category":"並行処理","term":"volatile","summary":"変数の最新値が各スレッドから見えるようにします。","examples":[{"code":"volatile boolean running;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0092"},{"lang":"java","category":"並行処理","term":"AtomicInteger","summary":"ロックなしで安全に数を増減できるクラス。","examples":[{"code":"counter.incrementAndGet();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0093"},{"lang":"java","category":"並行処理","term":"CompletableFuture","summary":"非同期処理をつなげて書ける仕組みです。","examples":[{"code":"CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -> 1).thenApply(n -> n + 1);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"java-0094"},{"lang":"java"